{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……呐，果然还是分手吧。”", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4146", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我希望你再考虑一下。”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是我觉得不行了……”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4147", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隔天，状况恶化了。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "每次对话，我跟纱凪的距离就越来越远。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是偏偏做不到生疏。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“事到如今也不能再叫你瓜生混帐了。”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4148", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也觉得叫你乾同学很别扭。”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“在不知不觉中变成这样了啊我们……”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4149", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说到底，被男生叫名字什么的，只有瓜生……啊啊，算了，只有新吾啊……”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4150", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一交往就要表现得生疏也是很奇怪呢。”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4151", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不然。”", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4152", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "社团教室中，纱凪小心翼翼地靠近我。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后在我伸手可及的地方停下脚步。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“两个人相处的时候靠近，有其他人在的时候，那个，就像以前那样……”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4153", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是……不要表现得太要好……”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4154", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她还是不适应在他人面前亲密吧。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那现在这样做可以吧？”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4155", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我摸摸纱凪的头，然后手指来到脸颊。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪没有逃，而是僵住看着我。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“像这样摸头，你会生气吗？”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不、不会生气啦……可是不知道要摆出什么表情才好。”", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4156", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还有，一直被摸就好像输给新吾一样会让我累积压力。”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4157", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“连这种事情都有胜负啊。”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对我来说很重要的！那个，对了……”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4158", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾有想让我摸的地方吗？”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4159", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“特别服务，我让你选想被摸的地方吧。不用客气尽管说。”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4160", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊不用了，我……”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好啦好啦，说说看。我会温柔摸你的～”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4161", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "突然这么说我也不知道怎么回答。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真的会很温柔的，不用担心喔。”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4162", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我没有担心那种事。”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就选最普通的摸头吗？", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想不到被自己女孩子摸了会高兴的部位。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还有，头很难摸所以禁止！……主要是身高差的问题。”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4163", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这让我更烦恼了。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呐，哪里比较好？说说看嘛。”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4164", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂，不用摸我的头了啦。”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4165", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个，可以留到下次再回答吗？”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，逃避了。唉，真是没劲……”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4166", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "深深的叹息。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后纱凪握起我的手。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那直到你决定前就一直这样。”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4167", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后温柔地开始抚摸我的手背。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，这样做或许很有恋人的感觉？”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4168", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是或许，我们本来就是恋人。”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……但是在教室不能做这种事。”", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4169", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我倒是无所谓喔。就算班上的人知道我跟纱凪的事……”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4170", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我不行。交往后就在人前亲热……”", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4171", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想到纱凪的性格，我能理解。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不只是纱凪。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也对恋人这个身份在意过头了。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "越想表现得自然反而不自然。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "彼此都没有恋爱经验，就像还在学走路的小宝宝。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉。很麻烦吧我……”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4172", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有啦。”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在只能两个人一点点地……", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学习怎么往前走。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "与新吾一起走在回家路上。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明很开心，笑不出来的时间却更长。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“会冷吗？”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会……新吾呢？”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4173", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪不会冷的话我也不会。”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那、那是什么道理嘛。”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4174", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么道理呢……我也不太懂。”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新吾说完后笑了，维持着和我之间的距离。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然趁势告白、交往了。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但我一直很不安。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自己是个够格站在新吾身旁的女孩子吗？", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……呐，新吾。”", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4175", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你喜欢我哪里？”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4176", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为不安所以想问。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明这种事很不像我。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应该不能说喜欢哪里。”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是觉得喜欢？”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4177", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“也不是那样。我只能说我喜欢纱凪。”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以就算出现其他长相、声音、个性相似的女孩，对我来说也不对。”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4178", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……又来了。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我又笑不出来了。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感觉……抱歉……”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4179", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明很开心，却又痛苦。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我对自己没有自信。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以才对同学们保密我和新吾的关系。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为我害怕。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘纱凪跟瓜生君不配吧。’", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是被人这样说。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那以后我每次看到新吾的笑容。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就会觉得不该是我。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像美羽学姐那样的人一定比较适合新吾。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么道歉？”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，没有……只是我不是值得别人这么喜欢的女人。”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4180", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“期待太大的话，之后的失望就越强喔……”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4181", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我这样想。”", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4182", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要有那样的想法。”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是！”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4183", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还有，抱歉。”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我现在也非常喜欢纱凪，但是我想以后会越来越喜欢。”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我没救了吧。”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新吾这么说，然后对我微笑。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我说不出话来。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，我很清楚一件事。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……要说没救的话，我也一样。”", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "_sn4184", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我已经没办法想像没有新吾的生活了。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
